│     │   └─0 text "nextest"
│     ├─2 text " to run Ruff's test suite (via "
│     ├─3 inlineCode "uv run --only-dev cargo nextest run"
│     ├─4 text "),\nthough it's not strictly necessary. Throughout this guide, any usages of "
│     ├─5 inlineCode "cargo test"
│     ├─6 text " can be replaced\nwith "
│     ├─7 inlineCode "uv run --only-dev cargo nextest run"
│     └─8 text "."
├─28  heading[1]
