│     │   │ spread: false
│     │   │ checked: null
│     │   └─0 paragraph[6]
│     │       ├─0 strong[1]
│     │       │   └─0 text "\"Local folder\""
│     │       ├─1 text ": the import is a relative import (e.g., "
│     │       ├─2 inlineCode "from .foo import bar"
│     │       ├─3 text "). This is easy\ntoo: just check if the import includes a "
│     │       ├─4 inlineCode "level"
│     │       └─5 text " (i.e., a dot-prefix)."
│     ├─3 listItem[1]
│     │   │ spread: false
│     │   │ checked: null
