│     │       │   └─0 text "\"First party\""
│     │       └─1 text ": the import is part of the current project. (More on this below.)"
│     └─4 listItem[1]
│         │ spread: false
│         │ checked: null
│         └─0 paragraph[2]
│             ├─0 strong[1]
│             │   └─0 text "\"Third party\""
│             └─1 text ": everything else."
├─199 paragraph[1]
│     └─0 text "The real challenge lies in determining whether an import is first-party — everything else is either\ntrivial, or (as in the case of third-party) merely defined as \"not first-party\"."
├─200 paragraph[1]
│     └─0 text "There are three ways in which an import can be categorized as \"first-party\":"
├─201 list[3]
│     │ ordered: true
│     │ start: 1
│     │ spread: false
│     ├─0 listItem[1]
│     │   │ spread: false
